<section class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">WE ARE HERE TO HELP</span><h1>How can we help today?</h1><p>Tell us what’s going on and our team will take a look.</p></section>
<section class="section two-column"><div class="panel"><h2>Quick answers</h2><details><summary>How do I follow my delivery?</summary><p>Open Track order and enter the reference from checkout. Sign in to view private order details.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change a placed order?</summary><p>Contact support as soon as possible and include the order reference.</p></details><p><a href="mailto:help@foodplan.bd">help@foodplan.bd</a></p></div><form class="panel form-stack" data-support-form><h2>Contact Foodplan support</h2><label>Subject<input name="subject" minlength="4" required></label><label>Order reference (optional)<input name="order_code" placeholder="FF-…"></label><label>Tell us more<textarea name="message" rows="5" minlength="10" required></textarea></label><p class="form-message" data-message></p><button class="button">Send request</button><div data-support-list></div></form></section>
